[[Image:Big-eared-townsend-fledermaus.jpg|thumb|right]]

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|vledermūs}}, from {{inh|de|goh|fledarmūs}}; derived from {{m|goh|fledarōn||flutter}}, from {{der|de|gem-pro|*fifaldǭ}} and {{m|goh|mūs||Maus}}, from {{der|de|gmw-pro|*mūs}}. See {{m|de|flattern}}, {{m|de|Maus}} for more.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈfleːdɐˌmaʊ̯s/}}
* {{audio|de|De-Fledermaus.ogg}}
* {{hyphenation|de|Fle|der|maus}}

